<%
  proficiency_body = capture do
%>
  <h3 class="c-h3 mb-2">MHA Competency Proficiency Scale</h3>
  <p class="mb-3 text-xs text-slate-600">Student achievement on the competencies is assessed using the following scale.</p>

  <div class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
    <div>
      <div class="font-semibold">Level 5 (Mastery): Strategic Leader</div>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-700">I am a recognized authority who pioneers solutions to complex, non-routine problems and drives high-level strategic decision-making with total autonomy.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="font-semibold">Level 4 (Experienced): Advanced Practitioner</div>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-700">I independently apply specialized theories to solve real-world problems and can articulate complex nuances to guide and mentor others.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="font-semibold">Level 3 (Capable): Autonomous Professional</div>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-700">I possess a solid practical grasp of my field, reliably executing standard tasks and contributing to team projects with minimal oversight.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="font-semibold">Level 2 (Emerging): Developing Associate</div>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-700">I am building my professional toolkit and can execute foundational tasks, though I require guidance and clear parameters for more complex assignments.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="font-semibold">Level 1 (Beginner): Foundational Learner</div>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-700">I am establishing a baseline awareness of core concepts and require structured supervision and mentorship to align my work with professional standards.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
        0 (Not able to assess)
        <span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-600">Advisor only</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600">Use when the advisor cannot evaluate the student at this time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
<% end %>

<%= render partial: "shared/question_tooltip",
           locals: {
             label: "Show proficiency scale details",
             panel_label: "MHA Proficiency Scale",
             width: "28rem",
             max_height: "60vh",
             panel_classes: "overflow-auto text-sm text-slate-800 space-y-3",
             body_html: proficiency_body
           } %>
